Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 15
Set LineHeight 1.25
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 24
Set Margin 20
Set MarginFill "#0d1117"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 10
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Hide
Type `source <(DEMO=/tmp/tidy-demo ./docs/demo/make-demo-folder.sh) && export PATH="$PWD/target/release:$PATH" CLICOLOR_FORCE=1 TERM=xterm-256color && export HOME="$TIDY_HOME" && unset NO_COLOR && cd "$TIDY_HOME/Downloads" && export PS1='\[\e[1;32m\]~/Downloads\[\e[0m\] \[\e[1;35m\]❯\[\e[0m\] ' && clear`
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
